notes.content:
After two years ...... we have a brand new version 2.0!


This update contains:

Script substantially revised and optimised;

A complete reset of the stand-up, background and UI;

Three new CGs and a new BGM;

New gallery and Steam achievement system;

Mac support has been added;

The deduction game and ‘Turtle Soup’ are now really playable!



If you've played it, welcome back! We've updated a lot of content to make the experience even better.

If you haven't played it yet - it's Summer Sale season, so get start tonight!



